Z||000000||ChadMan||02-29-2000||03:17 PM||||The only giveaway to this 87 Coupe's true nature is the vanity plate: "3800 TBI."<BR> <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/uploads/38001.jpg"> <BR>This guy and his dad did the conversion themselves.  It was beautiful - not a loose wire or greasy spot to be found.<BR> <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/uploads/38002.jpg"> <BR>I saw him at the 1999 show - he said he has 25K trouble-free miles on this car now.  He also has a digital dash, but it's not as cool as Cliff's so I'm not posting photos of that.  <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/forum/smile.gif">||||reg||1
